  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, due to its scale, bulk, massing, and unsympathetic fenestration and detailed design, would appear as an overly prominent, excessive and incongruous addition to the existing house, that would reduce the open appearance of this prominent corner site and close the gap to site boundaries. As such, it would have a detrimental impact on the character and appearance of the existing house and the surrounding Area of Special Local Character. The application is therefore contrary to policy D3 of the London Plan 2021, policies 28 and 30 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and 'Design of Residential Extensions' SPD4."
